OL,3,GNEWSA'I was at the pub - then my wife's
OL,4,Abag exploded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is warning about the dangers of
OL,7,F"knock off" vapes after his wife's bag
OL,8,Fblew up "like a firework".
OL,10,FDusty Sheppard said he was having a
OL,11,Fpint outside a pub in Gomshall in
OL,12,FSurrey on Friday when "all of a sudden
OL,13,Fflames flew out" of his wife's Maz's
OL,14,Fhandbag.
OL,16,F"It [was] like someone holding a Roman
OL,17,Fcandle," he told the BBC.
OL,19,F"She felt the heat against her leg,
OL,20,Fthrew her bag off and ran away like
OL,21,Feverybody else. [Her] reactions were
OL,22,Fvery good."
